error: this group derives `Schema`, which describes it as serde reads it for `QueryString<T>`, and serde reads this field as one nested member, so `QueryString<T>` and `Query<T>` would read the group differently. Add `#[serde(flatten)]` beside `#[param(flatten)]`, so both read the flattened group's members in its place
